  "releaseNotes": "Native AOT and trimming support: the net8.0 and net10.0 builds are marked IsAotCompatible and produce no trim or AOT warnings. LogEntry.ToJson() no longer needs reflection for its fixed fields or for scalar property values, and its output is unchanged in regular JIT applications. New ToJson(JsonSerializerOptions) overload serializes complex property values with a source-generated resolver under Native AOT. NaN and Infinity property values now serialize as strings instead of throwing. See CHANGELOG.md.",
